Feature: CCG redirects to DCB
  Retired CCG URLs permanently redirect to their mapped DCB pages.
  All paths use the configured Cypress baseUrl.

  Scenario Outline: Verify redirect and destination status for <from>
    When I request the CCG URL "<from>" without following redirects
    Then the CCG response status code is 301
    And the CCG redirect location is "<to>"
    When I follow the CCG redirects from "<from>"
    Then the CCG destination status code is 200 at "<to>"

    # The case-report-forms destination is hcmi-enrollment-crf, as confirmed.
    # The supplied cancer.gov data-portal destination uses the configured host.
